  "There are no diagnostic fault codes for this assembly. §5-2 was read end to end and not one of its codes names A20 or the CPU, even as a fallback after another board reads good — because A20 is the processor that runs the diagnostics and reports every other assembly's code. A fault here presents as an instrument that will not boot, or as codes raised against boards that are in fact healthy. Confirm the +5 V rail at TP6 and the reset lamp CR1 before believing any code raised against another assembly.",
